0..72 Comment "// `halted` performs an operation with no continuation inside an unwind."
73..75 Comment "//"
76..151 Comment "// An unwind runs to completion under the empty row. It must not stop on an"
152..189 Comment "// operation that no handler resumes."
190..192 Comment "//"
193..263 Comment "// The checker reads the unwind under the empty row. So it refuses the"
264..327 Comment "// operation there, as it refuses `abandon k` inside an unwind."
328..330 Comment "//"
331..384 Comment "// - see: #7968 — an operation with no continuation"
385..460 Comment "// - see: `../cancellation/shielded.gandr` — `abandon k` inside an unwind"
462..515 Comment "// The import provides the early-exit host interface."
